# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# .gitignore for the SAA-C03 Study Buddy Kiro power
#
# This project ships markdown steering files and an MCP config (no source code,
# no build artifacts). The rules below target OS/editor noise, local Kiro
# workspace state, and an accidental-secret safety net.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ---- Operating system files -------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
*~

# ---- Editors / IDEs ---------------------------------------------------------
# VS Code
.vscode/

# JetBrains
.idea/
*.iml

# Vim / Emacs / generic swap files
*.swp
*.swo
*.swn
\#*\#
.\#*

# Sublime Text
*.sublime-workspace
*.sublime-project

# ---- Kiro local workspace state --------------------------------------------
# Specs, hooks, and settings generated while using Kiro on this repo are
# personal workspace state and should not be shipped with the power.
.kiro/specs/
.kiro/hooks/
.kiro/settings/

# ---- Secrets safety net -----------------------------------------------------
# This project does not need credentials, but guard against accidents.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
credentials
credentials.json

# ---- User-specific local data -----------------------------------------------
# Exam result transcripts and template files are personal/local content.
templates/
ExamResults/

# ---- Logs and temp files ----------------------------------------------------
*.log
logs/
tmp/
temp/
